; Export surface of the WH33LH4X dinput8.dll proxy -- exactly the five entry points the real
; system dinput8.dll exports, and nothing else.
;
; A .def file rather than __declspec(dllexport) for two reasons:
;
;   1. combaseapi.h already declares DllGetClassObject and DllCanUnloadNow without the export
;      attribute. Adding it on a redeclaration is a clang warning (-Wdll-attribute-on-
;      redeclaration) and the attribute is not reliably honoured, which would silently produce
;      a DLL missing its COM entry points.
;
;   2. It names the exports exactly. A game resolves them by undecorated name; if a future
;      32-bit build is ever needed, __stdcall would decorate them as _DirectInput8Create@20
;      and the game would not find them. This file is the fix for that too.

LIBRARY dinput8
EXPORTS
    DirectInput8Create
    DllCanUnloadNow
    DllGetClassObject
    DllRegisterServer
    DllUnregisterServer
